{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49861","headline":"虞美人 二 · 冯延巳","name":"虞美人 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"春风拂拂横秋水，掩映遥相对。\n秪知长作碧窗期，谁信东风，吹散彩云飞。\n银屏梦与飞鸾远，秪有珠帘卷。\n杨花零落月溶溶，尘掩玉筝弦柱，画堂空。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"冯延巳","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49861.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49861","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}